	<element name="The Magus Class (2026)" type="Source" source="Core" id="ID_SVAC_SOURCE_THE_MAGUS_CLASS_2026">
		<description>
			<p><b>An Arcane Warrior Wielding Spell and Steel...</b></p>
			<p>The Magus is a spell-slinging, steel-wielding new class with six subclasses, perfect for mixing and matching magical themes and combat styles.</p>
			<p>New Features:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>The Magus class</li>
				<li><b>6 subclasses:</b> Arcane Order, Heaven’s Guard, Knights Stygian, Shadow Court, Sidereal Cabal, Sylvan Circle.</li>
				<li><b>30+ new spells</b> available to the Magus and expanding the spell lists of other classes.</li>
				<li><b>20 magic items</b> every aspiring gish will wish for.</li>
			</ul>
		</description>
